ogTitle: "AI Consulting & Automation — GullStack"
ogDescription: "Custom AI agents and automation workflows that replace manual busywork. Built for small businesses, not enterprises."
headerStyle: inner
activeNav: services
breadcrumb:
  - name: Services
    url: /services/
  - name: AI Consulting
    url: /services/ai-consulting/
faqs:
  - q: "What can AI actually do for my small business?"
    a: "AI can handle customer support via chatbot (like our own Bogey), draft blog posts and social media content, qualify leads automatically, summarize emails and documents, manage appointment scheduling, create proposals and invoices, analyze customer data for insights, and automate repetitive workflows. The key is identifying which manual tasks consume the most time and building AI solutions for those specific bottlenecks."
  - q: "How much does AI consulting cost?"
    a: "Custom AI agent builds start at $2,500 for a focused single-purpose agent (like a customer-facing chatbot). More complex automation workflows that connect multiple systems run $3,000-7,500. Ongoing AI management and optimization starts at $500/month. Every engagement begins with a free discovery call where we identify the highest-impact opportunities for your business."
  - q: "Is my business data safe with AI?"
    a: "Absolutely. We use enterprise-grade AI APIs with strict data handling policies. Your business data is never used to train public AI models. We can deploy AI agents that run on private infrastructure if your industry requires it (healthcare, legal, financial). All of our AI implementations comply with relevant data privacy regulations."
  - q: "Do I need technical knowledge to use AI tools?"
    a: "Not at all. We build AI tools that are as easy to use as sending a text message. Our custom agents have conversational interfaces — you talk to them in plain English. We handle all the technical setup, integration, and maintenance. You just use the tools and see the results."
  - q: "What is a custom AI agent like Bogey?"
    a: "Bogey is our own AI sales agent that lives on our website. It answers questions about our services, qualifies leads, and books consultations — 24 hours a day. We build similar agents for our clients, trained specifically on their business, services, pricing, and FAQs. Think of it as a knowledgeable employee that never sleeps, never calls in sick, and handles unlimited conversations simultaneously."
css: |
  .page-hero {
