  .comparison-row .human { color: #71717a; }
  .comparison-row .ai { color: var(--indigo); font-weight: 600; }
---

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">AI Consulting</span>
    <h1>Stop Doing Busywork. <span class="gradient-text">Let AI Handle It.</span></h1>
    <p>Custom AI agents, automation workflows, and intelligent tools built specifically for your business. We run our own company on AI — and we will show you how to do the same.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">See What AI Can Do &#8594;</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Problem Section -->
<section class="problem-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">The Problem</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">You Are Drowning in Manual Work</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Small business owners spend 40-60% of their time on tasks that could be automated. Every hour spent on repetitive busywork is an hour not spent on growing the business.</p>
    <div class="highlight-box fade-in">
      <ul>
        <li>You spend hours every week answering the same customer questions over and over</li>
        <li>Content creation takes forever — blog posts, social media, email newsletters pile up on your to-do list</li>
        <li>Lead follow-up falls through the cracks because you are too busy doing the actual work</li>
        <li>You cannot afford to hire a full-time employee for tasks that AI could handle at a fraction of the cost</li>
        <li>You know AI is powerful but have no idea how to actually implement it in your business</li>
        <li>You have tried ChatGPT but it feels generic — it does not know your business, your customers, or your voice</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Cost Comparison -->
<section style="padding: 40px 0 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">The Math Speaks for Itself</h2>
    <div class="comparison-table fade-in">
      <div class="comparison-row header">
        <span>Role</span>
        <span>Employee Cost</span>
        <span>AI Cost</span>
      </div>
      <div class="comparison-row">
        <span class="label">Content Manager</span>
        <span class="human">$50K+/yr</span>
        <span class="ai">$500/mo</span>
      </div>
      <div class="comparison-row">
        <span class="label">Customer Support (24/7)</span>
        <span class="human">$80K+/yr</span>
        <span class="ai">$300/mo</span>
      </div>
      <div class="comparison-row">
        <span class="label">Lead Qualification</span>
        <span class="human">$45K+/yr</span>
        <span class="ai">Included</span>
      </div>
      <div class="comparison-row">
        <span class="label">Admin & Data Entry</span>
        <span class="human">$35K+/yr</span>
        <span class="ai">$200/mo</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Solution Section -->
<section class="solution-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">The Solution</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">AI That Knows Your Business Inside and Out</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">We do not just hand you a ChatGPT login. We build custom AI agents trained on your business data, integrated with your tools, and designed to handle your specific workflows.</p>
    <div class="solution-copy fade-in">
      <p>Our AI consulting process starts with understanding what is eating your time. We audit your daily operations, identify the highest-impact automation opportunities, and build custom AI solutions that plug directly into how you already work.</p>
      <p>Every agent we build is trained on your specific business — your services, your pricing, your FAQ, your brand voice. When a customer talks to your AI agent, it sounds like talking to someone who actually works at your company. Because in a real sense, it does.</p>
      <p>We practice what we preach. Bogey, the AI agent on our own website, handles lead qualification, answers service questions, and books consultations around the clock. The technology works. We use it every day.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Features Grid -->
<section class="features-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">AI Solutions We Build</h2>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="glass-card fade-in">
        <div class="icon">&#129302;</div>
        <h3>Custom AI Agents</h3>
        <p>Conversational agents like Bogey that live on your website, answer questions, qualify leads, and book appointments — 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass-card fade-in">
        <div class="icon">&#9889;</div>
        <h3>Workflow Automation</h3>
        <p>Connect your tools and automate multi-step processes. New lead comes in? AI qualifies them, adds them to your CRM, sends a welcome email, and notifies your team — automatically.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass-card fade-in">
        <div class="icon">&#9997;&#65039;</div>
        <h3>Content AI</h3>
        <p>AI trained on your brand voice that creates blog posts, social media content, email campaigns, and marketing copy. You review and approve — it does the heavy lifting.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass-card fade-in">
        <div class="icon">&#128172;</div>
        <h3>Customer Support Bots</h3>
        <p>AI chat that handles common questions, troubleshoots issues, and escalates complex cases to your team. Slash your support response time to seconds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass-card fade-in">
        <div class="icon">&#128200;</div>
        <h3>Data & Analytics AI</h3>
        <p>Turn messy spreadsheets into actionable insights. AI analyzes your sales data, customer behavior, and marketing performance to surface what matters most.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass-card fade-in">
        <div class="icon">&#128295;</div>
        <h3>Tool Integration</h3>
        <p>Connect AI to the tools you already use — Google Workspace, CRMs, email platforms, scheduling software. No rip-and-replace. Just smarter workflows.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ Section -->
<section class="faq-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      {% for faq in faqs %}
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question">
          <span>{{ faq.q }}</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">{{ faq.a }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Case Study -->
<section class="case-study-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="quote-block fade-in">
      <p class="quote-text">"Agile Counseling's intake process used to take 3-4 days of back-and-forth emails. We automated the entire workflow with AI — now new clients are matched, scheduled, and onboarded within hours, not days."</p>
      <p class="quote-cite">See how AI transformed their operations. <a href="/case-studies/agile-counseling/">Read the Agile Counseling case study &#8594;</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-box fade-in">
      <h2>Ready to Put <span class="gradient-text">AI to Work</span>?</h2>
      <p>Talk to Bogey about your business. He will identify which manual tasks are eating your time and show you exactly how AI can handle them — starting this week.</p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Talk to Bogey &#8594;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
